+- HELP -------------------------+
| navigation                     |
| up/k up | down/j down          |
| pgup page up                   |
| pgdown page down | home top    |
| end bottom                     |
| page actions                   |
| enter open | t review tx       |
| / filter | r reload | esc back |
| global                         |
| 1-8 pages | :/ctrl+p palette   |
| c connect                      |
| tab/shift+tab focus pane       |
| ? this | q quit / back         |
| ctrl+c graceful quit           |
